{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And He rested on the seventh day.</b> As if Scripture itself written rest, to teach from it a fortiori: a person, whose work is in toil and exertion — all the more so should he rest on the Sabbath (Mekhilta)." "<b>And blessed it, and sanctified it.</b> He blessed it in the manna — that it be doubled on the sixth, a double portion of bread; and He sanctified it in the manna — that it did not fall on it (Mekhilta)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:17.425874909Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}